| 01 | [Credit Core](./01-credit-core.md) | `CREDITS`/`HOUSEHOLD_CREDITS` enum, cap = `invoice_limit × avg_tokens`, presign check-only, worker token charging, `/me/usage`, admin repoint, refund removal |
